.SH "نام (NAME)"
imv-msg \- Utility for sending commands to a running imv instance
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.sp
imv\-msg is a tool to simplify the sending of commands to a running instance of imv\&. Given an instance\(cqs pid it opens the corresponding unix socket and sends the provided command\&.
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.sp
\fIimv\-msg\fR <pid> <command>
.SH "نویسندگان (AUTHORS)"
.sp
imv\-msg is written and maintained by Harry Jeffery <me@harry\&.pm>
.sp
Full source code and other information can be found at https://sr\&.ht/~exec64/imv\&.
.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
.sp
\fBimv\fR(1)
